    ./go_marshal.json:3:14
    ./schema.cue:5:1
Int: conflicting values "1" and int (mismatched types string and int):
    ./decls/p_go_gen.cue:10:15
    ./go_marshal.json:2:12
    ./schema.cue:5:1
Named: conflicting values "2" and int (mismatched types string and int):
    ./decls/p_go_gen.cue:7:9
    ./decls/p_go_gen.cue:14:15
    ./go_marshal.json:6:14
    ./schema.cue:5:1
Pointer: 2 errors in empty disjunction:
Pointer: conflicting values "3" and int (mismatched types string and int):
    ./decls/p_go_gen.cue:15:22
    ./go_marshal.json:7:16
